  <!-- LOCAL PROOF -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#fef3c7;border-top:3px solid var(--orange);border-bottom:3px solid var(--orange);">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">We're Local Knowsley. Same Council as Huyton.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:0;">Our base is at <strong>29 Park Road, Kirkby, L32 2AL</strong>. Same Knowsley Council as Huyton. The M57 connects Kirkby and Huyton in 10 minutes. We guarantee a 30 minute response.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-top:0.75rem;">The other plumbers ranking for emergency plumber Huyton are based in Liverpool, Lancashire or are national call centres dispatching to whoever's nearest. We're the local Knowsley plumbers.</p>
      </div>
