        <a href="/boiler-repair-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Boiler Repair Huyton</strong><span>No heating or hot water? Emergency boiler repair 24/7. From £120 for the first hour, including diagnosis. No call-out fee.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/leak-detection-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Leak Detection Huyton</strong><span>Hidden leak, damp patch or a water bill that jumped? We find it with pressure tests and careful checks, then fix it.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/emergency-gas-engineer-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Emergency Gas Engineer Huyton</strong><span>Gas Safe registered engineers 24/7 for boilers, gas cookers and hobs. Smell gas? Call 0800 111 999 first, then call us.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/boiler-service-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Boiler Service Huyton</strong><span>Annual boiler service from £120. Gas Safe engineers. Certificate same day. Keeps your warranty valid.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/gas-safety-certificate-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>CP12 for Huyton Landlords</strong><span>CP12 paperwork from £100 per property. Same-day if needed. Batch pricing for landlords with several L36 rentals.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/power-flushing-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Power Flushing Huyton</strong><span>Cold radiators or noisy boiler? Power flush from £395 for systems up to 6 radiators. Protects your new boiler warranty.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/radiators-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Radiator Repairs and Swaps</strong><span>New radiators from £245 supply and fit. TRV upgrades from £65. Common upgrade in Huyton's 1950s semis.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
        <a href="/showers-liverpool" class="pf-related-link"><div><strong>Shower Installation and Repairs</strong><span>Electric showers from £375 supply and fit. Shower mixer from £395. Repairs at our hourly rates.</span></div><span class="pf-related-arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
